## services this box runs

=> /services.gmi   other protocols, explained (Gopher, DICT, QOTD, FTP...)
=> https://dreamstation.systems/professional/status   status page (HTTP only)

* a NTP/NTS-KE server in the NTP Pool
* this capsule, including OpenGET
* Gopher
* Gemini
* Spartan
* finger (try: finger @dreamstation.systems)
* DICT
* a FTP archive
* QOTD
* Daytime
* Echo
* Discard
* Chargen

=> /ntpuserinfo.gmi                how to use the dreamstation.systems NTP server
=> /ntpstats.gmi                   NTP server stats (auto-regenerating)
=> /ge/                            OpenGET
=> gopher://dreamstation.systems   the same place, over Gopher
=> spartan://dreamstation.systems  the same place, over Spartan
=> ftp://dreamstation.systems      the FTP archive

